  "moderationRulesBody": "Content you share on Timer.Coffee is automatically reviewed. Submissions may be rejected if they contain:\n\n- **Links or contact details** — URLs, phone numbers, email addresses, or any obfuscated versions\n- **Hateful or offensive content** — hate speech, harassment, or discrimination of any kind\n- **Explicit content** — sexually explicit material or graphic descriptions of violence\n- **Dangerous content** — promotion of self-harm or other dangerous activities\n\nThese rules apply when publishing a recipe (private recipes are not reviewed), to bean review text, your display name, and profile pictures. Ratings and other non-text fields are not affected.\n\nIf your submission is rejected, you'll see a reason and can edit and resubmit. There is no manual appeal process — if you believe the rejection was a mistake, try rephrasing your content.",
